    "facts": [
      "P10_1_RUNTIME_FLAG_DUPLICATE_SEGMENT maps to bit 8 of P9_FAULT_INJECTION.",
      "P9_FAULT_INJECTION bits 15:8 are the bounded ACK-drop count, so bit 8 requests exactly one dropped ACK.",
      "The endpoint transport uses four-DATA-frame bursts and cumulative ACKs.",
      "The hardware RTO is 4000000 cycles at 64 MHz, or 62.5 ms.",
      "The receiver duplicate counter increments only when a retransmitted DATA sequence is actually rejected as duplicate."
    ]
